Apply the exact gate to ResponsibilityMatrix: No silent assignment of unaccepted obligations and no uncovered mandatory function. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
